{
  "_doc": [
    "Plant classification seed. One entry per AP plant item, in the terse form",
    "  \"<elements> ; <role:band,...> ; <extra flags>\"",
    "with all three fields comma-separated inside and any of them empty.",
    "",
    "This file is JUDGEMENT, and it says so -- unlike constants.py's lists it is",
    "not derived from the game sheets. classify.py treats it as the SEED and",
    "then overwrites what it can measure: sun cost, recharge, damage numbers and",
    "the four flags constants.py already derives (jester_safe, consumable,",
    "timed, no_data). Every field in the built record carries a provenance of",
    "'curated' or 'derived' so the site can show which is which, and a curated",
    "band that the extractor contradicts is reported by data/test_data.py rather",
    "than silently kept.",
    "",
    "Bands are relative, not absolute: b1..b5 are quintiles of the role's own",
    "measured distribution. Seed them by feel; classify.py re-bands them against",
    "real numbers as soon as a game checkout is available."
  ],
